WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.420 --> 00:00:04.230
Lamp for admins. Part one: your team.

2
00:00:04.670 --> 00:00:06.380
Admins get one more tab: Team.

3
00:00:06.750 --> 00:00:09.620
To add a rep, type their full name and email.

4
00:00:14.570 --> 00:00:23.160
Reports to puts them on an admin's team. Applications they send go out in that admin's name, and the signed files land in the rep's own files.

5
00:00:23.710 --> 00:00:27.080
Leave it on Nobody, and they send in their own name.

6
00:00:27.470 --> 00:00:31.120
Tick Make admin only for people who run the desk.

7
00:00:31.590 --> 00:00:37.540
Add and email sends them a welcome from the partners mailbox, with how to sign in, and their two application links.

8
00:00:38.050 --> 00:00:40.200
The table shows everyone on the team.

9
00:00:40.580 --> 00:00:44.770
Sign-in shows whether they've signed in yet, or when they were invited.

10
00:00:45.230 --> 00:00:48.300
Change who someone reports to right in the table.

11
00:00:48.720 --> 00:00:52.450
The admin box gives or takes away admin rights.

12
00:00:52.970 --> 00:00:57.900
Untick On the team when someone leaves. Their links stop working right away.

13
00:00:58.300 --> 00:01:01.250
Resend invite sends the welcome email again.

14
00:01:01.630 --> 00:01:03.300
Next: running the board.
